          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>James Watt's Early Life</strong><br>\nJames Watt was born in 1736 in Greenock, Scotland. He displayed a talent for mathematics and manual work from a young age, which led him to become a scientific instrument maker after university, setting the stage for his future inventions.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The Newcomen Engine Improvement</strong><br>\nWhile repairing a Newcomen steam engine, Watt realized its inefficiency due to the repeated heating and cooling of the cylinder. His invention of a separate condenser in 1765 greatly improved steam engine efficiency, a leap forward for industrial technology.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Partnership with Matthew Boulton</strong><br>\nWatt struggled to commercialize his invention until he partnered with manufacturer Matthew Boulton in 1775. Their firm, Boulton and Watt, became the foremost engine-making enterprise of the Industrial Revolution.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
        "slideBackgroundSelector": {}
      },
      {
        "elements": [
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 4.415011037527593,
            "width": 37.98882681564246,
            "height": 8.830022075055187,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:1.5em;\"><strong>INFORMATION TEXT (Part 2)</strong></span></p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "55aaf4d3-f7e3-4a3e-9196-01a6f7474f94"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
